# NOTICE

Unmodified base MGDM models (Minimale Geodatenmodelle des Bundes),
retrieved from the official model repositories
(`models.geo.admin.ch` / `models.kgk-cgc.ch`):

- `Fruchtfolgeflaechen_V1.ili` — Geobasisdatensatz Nr. 68
- `Waldreservate_V2_0.ili` — Geobasisdatensatz Nr. 159
- `Wildruhezonen_V2_1.ili` — Geobasisdatensatz Nr. 121
- `Laermempfindlichkeitsstufen_V1_2.ili` — Nutzungsplanung, Geobasisdatensatz Nr. 73

Used by `tests/test_view_wfs_crosscheck.py` to pin the attribute set the
model builder extracts from real production models against the frozen
geodienste WFS publication schemas in `tests/fixtures/wfs-schemas/`. They
build standalone (their `IMPORTS` of the standard geometry / localisation
/ catalogue models are not needed for attribute-name extraction).
